# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / macOS 混用产生无意义的整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须用 CRLF：
#   · 批处理（.cmd/.bat）用 LF 会导致 goto / for 行为异常，甚至找不到标签
#   · PowerShell 5.1 对 CRLF 的兼容性也更好
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 明确二进制文件
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.pt   binary
*.onnx binary
